++```diff
++- const double ruI = ray_on ? +gamma2 * atm->xpl[j] * xtlc_u : 0.0;
++- const double ruQ = ray_on ? +alpha2 * atm->xrl[j] * xtlc_u : 0.0;
++- const double ruU = ray_on ? +alpha2 * atm->xtl[j] * xtlc_u : 0.0;
+++ const double ruI = ray_on ? -gamma2 * atm->xpl[j] * xtlc_u : 0.0;
+++ const double ruQ = ray_on ? -alpha2 * atm->xrl[j] * xtlc_u : 0.0;
+++ const double ruU = ray_on ? -alpha2 * atm->xtl[j] * xtlc_u : 0.0;
++```
