++M12: OCRT/OSOAA ~1.010..1.011
++M21: OCRT/OSOAA ~1.017..1.018
++M23: sign/shape nearly identical
++M32: nearly equal magnitude, opposite sign
++M13/M31: not explained by one global scale/sign
